{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#card-zh","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry 是一款 DSH 宿主侧插件，在 agent 请求错误处理流程中接管指定模型的分钟级 TPM 限流。它仅处理白名单 provider 上带 QUOTA 代码且错误信息符合限流措辞的失败，按窗口等待后重试。功能包括识别限流错误、遵守服务端建议等待时间、限制每步重试次数，以及在取消或卸载时中止等待。适合使用 qwen-token-plan 且希望分钟级限流后自动恢复的 DSH 用户。通过 profile 配置加载，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-247","cordis.patch.yml:13-22"]}
{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#card-en","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry is a DSH host plugin for minute-window TPM throttling. It retries matching QUOTA errors from selected providers, honoring provider delays and a per-step attempt cap. Cancellation stops the wait. For qwen-token-plan users; loaded through a DSH profile, with no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-247","cordis.patch.yml:13-22"]}
