{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#feature-1","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry 的功能「筛选分钟级限流」：仅当 provider 在白名单内且 QUOTA 错误符合指定限流措辞时接管。遇到其他错误会交给原有处理流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:89-94","lib/index.js:189-193"]}
{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#feature-2","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry 的功能「等待后重试」：命中限流后对齐下一个窗口边界，或优先采用 providerRetryAfterMs，并返回 retry 让当前步骤继续执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:97-113","lib/index.js:217-235"]}
{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#feature-3","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry 的功能「限制重试预算」：按 provider、turn 和 step 记录等待次数，超过配置的最大次数后交回终止处理流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:194-209"]}
{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#feature-4","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry 的功能「取消等待」：等待期间监听 turn 与插件生命周期信号；信号中止时清除计时器并结束等待，不返回重试决定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-134","lib/index.js:213-216"]}
{"unit_id":"wsfangyou__dsh-tpm-quota-retry#caveat-1","repo":"wsfangyou/dsh-tpm-quota-retry","commit":"f7bfdec5b5d28c35ea7362d119ed7d28da79baf7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tpm-quota-retry 使用进程内的会话账本记录重试预算；进程重启后同一步骤会重新计数，相关等待预算可能再次使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:158-161","lib/index.js:194-211"]}
